{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02988","headline":"杂诗五首 五 · 张九龄","name":"杂诗五首 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木直几自寇，石坚亦他攻。\n何言爲用薄，而与火膏同。\n物类有固然，谁能取径通。\n纤纤良田草，靡靡唯从风。\n日夜沐甘泽，春秋等芳丛。\n生性苟不夭，香臭谁爲中。\n道家贵至柔，儒生何固穷。\n终始行一意，无乃过愚公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02988.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02988","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}